  "releaseNotes": "v5.3.6: Fix BatchSubmitJobAsync splitDuration being mis-mapped to databento-cpp (Month was sent as year, Day as week, None as day) and the returned BatchJob.SplitDuration being decoded with the wrong ordering. Adds SplitDuration.Year. Unsupported Compression/Delivery values now fail with a clear error instead of being sent as \"Unknown\" (Issue #37).",
